      "statement": "The legacy interactive bootstrap uses three-second response deadlines and 500 ms quiet timeouts, retains an unbounded late scanner after initial timeout, and skips late supported installation after user input. The readiness-driven worker also has a 100 ms timer and reads/polls before pending writes; these interactive transitions do not govern prepared runtime startup.",
