      "statement": "Legacy draft composition permits one timed read and clear-plus-bracketed-paste replacement. Runtime drafts instead use a single UUID request, capability/input/generation checks, exact tmux reinspection and sequence/readiness/deadline-bound widget requests, with optional original-buffer comparison and bounded NUL-free replacements. Tmux capabilities require client tty binding, matching pane process and foreground shell; unsafe modes withhold directory/drafts, prefix mode only withholds drafts, and unintegrated panes gain no capabilities.",
